-  folder_drop.py auto FOLDER URL...   move within the same drive, copy to another drive
-  folder_drop.py copy FOLDER URL...   always copy
-  folder_drop.py trash URL...         put in the Trash
-  folder_drop.py open APP URL...      open with the app (a desktop file id)
